@startuml UC-11-Kelola-Kuis
title Sequence Diagram: Kelola Kuis (Buat/Edit/Hapus)

actor "Users (Creator)" as User
participant "Halaman Kelola Kuis\ndengan Editor Soal\n(React)" as UI
participant "POST /api/kuis\nPUT /api/kuis/:id\nDELETE /api/kuis/:id" as API
participant "KuisController" as Controller
participant "KuisService\nXPService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel Kuis, Soal,\nKunciJawaban,\nPengguna)" as DB

== Flow Normal - Buat Kuis Baru ==

User -> UI: Mengakses menu "Kelola Kuis"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/kuis/my-kuis
activate API
API -> Controller: getMyKuis()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getKuisByCreator(userId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Kuis\nWHERE idCreator = '[userId]'\nORDER BY tanggalBuat DESC
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return daftar kuis
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true, data: [...] }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Data kuis
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> User: Menampilkan daftar kuis\ndan tombol "Buat Kuis Baru"
User -> UI: Klik "Buat Kuis Baru"
UI --> User: Tampilkan form:\nJudul, Materi Terkait,\nAturan (Markdown),\nBatas Waktu, Bobot Poin
User -> UI: Mengisi judul kuis
User -> UI: Pilih materi terkait\n(opsional)
User -> UI: Tulis aturan/instruksi\ndalam Markdown
User -> UI: Atur batas waktu\n(misal: 30 menit)
User -> UI: Atur bobot poin\n(misal: 10 poin/soal)
User -> UI: Klik "Lanjut ke Soal"
UI --> User: Tampilkan editor soal

loop Menyusun soal (minimal 1)
    User -> UI: Menyusun soal dalam Markdown
    User -> UI: Tambahkan pilihan jawaban\n(A, B, C, D)
    User -> UI: Tandai jawaban yang benar
    User -> UI: Klik "Tambah Soal Lagi"\natau "Selesai"
end

User -> UI: Klik "Simpan Kuis"
UI -> UI: Validasi client-side\n(minimal 1 soal, semua\npunya jawaban benar)

alt Validasi berhasil
    UI -> API: POST /api/kuis\n{ judulKuis, idMateriTerkait,\naturanMarkdown, batasWaktuMenit,\npoinXPDefault, soal: [...] }
    activate API
    API -> Controller: createKuis()
    activate Controller
    Controller -> Service: saveNewKuis(data)
    activate Service
    Service -> Service: Validasi format Markdown\ndan kelengkapan data
    
    alt Data kuis valid
        Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
        activate DB
        Service -> DB: INSERT INTO Kuis\n(judulKuis, idMateriTerkait,\naturanMarkdown, batasWaktuMenit,\npoinXPDefault, idCreator,\ntanggalBuat)\nVALUES ('[judul]', '[materiId]',\n'[aturan]', 30, 10,\n'[userId]', NOW())
        DB --> Service: Return idKuis baru
        
        loop Untuk setiap soal
            Service -> DB: INSERT INTO Soal\n(idKuis, pertanyaanMarkdown,\nopsiA, opsiB, opsiC, opsiD,\nurutan)\nVALUES ('[kuisId]',\n'[pertanyaan]',\n'[A]', '[B]', '[C]', '[D]', 1)
            DB --> Service: Return idSoal baru
            Service -> DB: INSERT INTO KunciJawaban\n(idSoal, jawabanBenar)\nVALUES ('[soalId]', 'A')
            DB --> Service: Kunci jawaban tersimpan
        end
        
        Service -> Service: Kalkulasi XP Creator\n(30 XP + 5 XP per soal)
        Service -> DB: UPDATE Pengguna SET\nxpCreator = xpCreator + 80,\ntotalXP = totalXP + 80\nWHERE idAkun = '[userId]'
        DB --> Service: XP UPDATE success
        Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
        DB --> Service: Transaction committed
        deactivate DB
        Service --> Controller: { success: true,\nkuisId: X, xpGained: 80 }
        Controller --> API: Response 201 Created
        API --> UI: Response sukses
        UI --> User: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Kuis berhasil dibuat!\n+80 XP Creator"
        UI --> User: Redirect ke daftar kuis
    else Data tidak valid
        Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Kuis tidak valid" }
        Controller --> API: Response 400 Bad Request
        API --> UI: Error response
        UI --> User: Tampilkan error,\nkuis tidak disimpan
    end
    
    deactivate Service
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate API
    
else Validasi gagal
    UI --> User: Tampilkan error validasi\n(misal: "Minimal 1 soal",\n"Soal #X belum punya\njawaban benar")
end

deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow A - Edit Kuis ==

User -> UI: Pilih kuis dan klik "Edit"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/kuis/:id/edit
activate API
API -> Controller: getKuisForEdit(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: checkOwnershipAndGetData(id, userId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Kuis\nWHERE idKuis = '[id]'\nAND idCreator = '[userId]'
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return data kuis
deactivate DB

alt User adalah pembuat
    Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Soal\nWHERE idKuis = '[id]'\nORDER BY urutan
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: Return soal-soal\ndengan kunci jawaban
    deactivate DB
    Service --> Controller: { success: true, data: {...} }
    Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
    API --> UI: Data lengkap
    deactivate Service
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate API
    UI --> User: Tampilkan editor dengan\ndata kuis dan soal existing
    User -> UI: Mengubah judul, aturan,\natau soal (tambah/edit/hapus)
    User -> UI: Klik "Simpan Perubahan"
    UI -> API: PUT /api/kuis/:id
    activate API
    API -> Controller: updateKuis(id)
    activate Controller
    Controller -> Service: updateKuis(id, data, userId)
    activate Service
    Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    activate DB
    Service -> DB: UPDATE Kuis SET ...\nWHERE idKuis = '[id]'
    DB --> Service: Kuis updated
    Service -> DB: DELETE FROM Soal\nWHERE idKuis = '[id]'\n(hapus soal lama)
    DB --> Service: Soal lama terhapus
    Service -> DB: INSERT soal-soal baru
    DB --> Service: Soal baru tersimpan
    Service -> DB: UPDATE Pengguna SET\nxpCreator = xpCreator + 10\n(lebih sedikit untuk edit)
    DB --> Service: XP updated
    Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    DB --> Service: Transaction committed
    deactivate DB
    Service --> Controller: { success: true, xpGained: 10 }
    Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
    API --> UI: Response sukses
    deactivate Service
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate API
    UI --> User: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Kuis berhasil diupdate\n+10 XP"
else User bukan pembuat
    Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Unauthorized" }
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> API: Response 403 Forbidden
    deactivate Controller
    API --> UI: Error
    deactivate API
    UI --> User: Tampilkan error\n"Anda tidak memiliki akses"
end

deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow B - Hapus Kuis ==

User -> UI: Pilih kuis dan klik "Hapus"
activate UI
UI --> User: Tampilkan konfirmasi\n"Yakin hapus kuis?\nSemua soal dan hasil\nakan terhapus"
User -> UI: Klik "Ya, Hapus"
UI -> API: DELETE /api/kuis/:id
activate API
API -> Controller: deleteKuis(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: deleteKuis(id, userId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: DELETE FROM Kuis\nWHERE idKuis = '[id]'\nAND idCreator = '[userId]'\n(cascade delete ke Soal\ndan KunciJawaban)
activate DB
DB --> Service: DELETE success
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Response sukses
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> User: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Kuis berhasil dihapus"
UI -> UI: Update daftar kuis
deactivate UI

== Alternate: Preview Kuis ==

note over User, UI
  User bisa klik "Preview Kuis"
  untuk melihat simulasi kuis
  seperti yang dilihat learner
  sebelum menyimpan
end note

@enduml
